<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: gestate hyrax -->
  <DMS_Make_Hyrax.label>組裝蹄兔</DMS_Make_Hyrax.label>
  <!-- EN: Gestate a hyrax Automatroid. A remote weapon station mounted on a light tracked chassis - the kind of simple automatic weapon that tends to be the first practical product any drone manufacturer ships. It is cheap, quick to build, and entirely indifferent to what it is sent to do.\n\nThe tracked chassis keeps it from being staggered under fire, it draws half the power of a comparable mech, and it will haul cargo on days when there is no fighting to be done. In exchange it is structurally fragile, slow on its tracks, and permanently married to one fixed submachine gun turret. Use it for reconnaissance by fire in built-up terrain; its value was never in coming back. -->
  <DMS_Make_Hyrax.description>組裝蹄兔，一種以輕型履帶底盤搭載遙控機槍塔的無人載具。這類構造簡單的自動武器通常是各家軍火商開發的第一件實用無人機系統。\n\n履帶底盤使其受到近戰攻擊時不會因此減速，動力消耗僅為同級機兵的一半，沒有交火的日子還能充當搬運工。代價是脆弱的結構強度、以及緩慢的行進速度。適合在巷戰中執行火力偵查或者用於基地駐防。</DMS_Make_Hyrax.description>
  <!-- EN: Gestating mech. -->
  <DMS_Make_Hyrax.jobString>組裝機械體中</DMS_Make_Hyrax.jobString>

  <!-- EN: gestate falcon -->
  <DMS_Make_Falcon.label>組裝游隼</DMS_Make_Falcon.label>
  <!-- EN: Gestate a Falcon Automatroid. A light tri-rotor drone built for armed aerial reconnaissance and anti-armor strikes. Cheap to produce and costing a single point of bandwidth, it is the least expensive set of eyes a mechanitor can put in the air.\n\nIt crosses terrain that would stop a ground unit, moves at roughly twice their pace, and is rated to carry a disposable anti-tank launcher - letting it kill armor a unit of its weight class has no business engaging. It also has almost no plating and very little structure behind it, so the first solid hit is usually the last one. Flight time is limited, and its armament is restricted to light weapons and thrown ordnance. -->
  <DMS_Make_Falcon.description>組裝游隼，一種輕型三旋翼飛行器，用於空中武裝偵察與反裝甲打擊。低廉的造價與不高的控制頻寬使它成為機械師手上最便宜的前沿偵查火力。\n\n它能飛越地面單位無法通過的地形，速度約為地面機兵的兩倍，並能夠掛載拋棄式反戰車發射器得以擊毀遠超其噸位的目標。但它幾乎沒有裝甲，結構也極為單薄，武裝也僅限於輕型槍械與投擲物。</DMS_Make_Falcon.description>
  <!-- EN: Gestating mech. -->
  <DMS_Make_Falcon.jobString>組裝機械體中</DMS_Make_Falcon.jobString>

  <!-- EN: Gestate Noctula -->
  <DMS_Make_Noctula.label>組裝夜蝠</DMS_Make_Noctula.label>
  <!-- EN: Gestate a Noctula Automatroid, the command-relay variant of the Falcon. The weight freed by stripping its weapon hardpoints goes into an optical camouflage module and a relay antenna, letting it loiter behind the enemy line and hold the command chain open for hunters and forward detachments.\n\nAt rest it is all but invisible to observation, and it pushes a mechanitor's control envelope out well past the local map. The cost is three times the Falcon's bandwidth, a transmitter component, and effectively no ability to defend itself - it will only carry ultra-light equipment. The Noctula does not fight; it lets everything else fight. -->
  <DMS_Make_Noctula.description>組裝夜蝠，游隼的指令中繼改裝型。拆除武器掛架所騰出的重量被用於安裝光學匿蹤模組與中繼天線，使它能夠在敵方陣線後方懸停，為獵兵與前沿分隊維持指揮鏈。\n\n它在靜止時對觀測近乎透明，並能將機械師的控制範圍向外延伸至本地地圖之外。代價是較高的帶寬需求以及有限的武器攜帶能力。</DMS_Make_Noctula.description>
  <!-- EN: Gestating mech. -->
  <DMS_Make_Noctula.jobString>組裝機械體中</DMS_Make_Noctula.jobString>

  <!-- EN: Gestate Dogge -->
  <DMS_Make_Dogge.label>組裝獒犬</DMS_Make_Dogge.label>
  <!-- EN: Gestate a Dogge Automatroid, a four-legged machine gun platform. Synthetic muscle bundles in its limbs give it uncommon cross-country mobility, and its low silhouette suits it to providing mobile fire support across open ground - typically running down routed infantry, or counter-guerrilla work.\n\nIt carries an auto-engaging fixed machine gun turret alongside a separate hardpoint that will take a flamethrower for close work, and it moves fast enough to keep pace with any advance. The artificial muscle is expensive to culture, its plating stops fragments and small calibers and not much else, and the hardpoint will not accept a long-barrelled weapon. The Dogge is built to pursue, not to hold ground. -->
  <DMS_Make_Dogge.description>組裝獒犬，一種四足機槍平臺。四肢中的人工肌肉束賦予它罕見的越野機動力，而低矮的車身輪廓使其擅長在開闊地帶提供伴隨火力，通常被用於清剿潰散的敵軍與反游擊作戰。\n\n它同時保有一座自動接戰的固定機槍塔與一個獨立武器掛點，可換裝噴火器執行近距離作業，其移動速度也足以跟上任何一次推進。但人工肌肉的培養成本高昂，其裝甲僅足以應付破片與小口徑彈，掛點亦無法容納長管槍械。獒犬適合用來追擊高機動性的輕裝游擊隊與逃跑的囚犯，但也可以攜帶反戰車火箭彈來在巷戰中以小博大。</DMS_Make_Dogge.description>
  <!-- EN: Gestating mech. -->
  <DMS_Make_Dogge.jobString>組裝機械體中</DMS_Make_Dogge.jobString>

  <!-- EN: Gestate Soldat -->
  <DMS_Make_Soldat.label>組裝士兵</DMS_Make_Soldat.label>
  <!-- EN: Gestate a Soldat Automatroid, a mass-produced bipedal humanoid built to fight alongside armored units on the main line. Its value is not individual performance but compatibility: it uses human-rated small arms and the supply chain that already carries them, so no separate production line has to be opened to keep it fed.\n\nIt occupies a single point of bandwidth, its external battery pack lets it draw noticeably less power than comparable mechs, and it can take over most crew-served weapon mounts. That pack is also its weakness - the Soldat is poorly protected against blunt trauma, walks slowly, and is limited to industrial-grade light weapons. Caught in the open, it is a target that happens to shoot back. -->
  <DMS_Make_Soldat.description>組裝士兵型機兵，一種雙足人形量產機體，用於在正面戰場上與裝甲單位協同作戰。它的價值不在單機性能，而在於對既有補給體系的兼容性。\n\n它僅佔一點控制頻寬，外掛電池背包使其耗電低於同級機體，並能接手操作部分固定機槍陣地。士兵型的鈍擊防護薄弱、步行速度緩慢，因此暴露在開闊地十分脆弱。</DMS_Make_Soldat.description>
  <!-- EN: Gestating mech. -->
  <DMS_Make_Soldat.jobString>組裝機械體中</DMS_Make_Soldat.jobString>

  <!-- EN: Gestate Grenadier -->
  <DMS_Make_Grenadier.label>組裝擲彈兵</DMS_Make_Grenadier.label>
  <!-- EN: Gestate a Grenadier Automatroid, the indirect-fire variant of the Soldat. Its fire control unit is recalibrated for ballistic arcs, letting it work grenade launchers, thrown ordnance and mortar mounts against targets that direct fire cannot reach behind cover.\n\nIt is the most efficient mass-produced platform available for clearing fortified positions and demolishing structures, and it carries an integral flash launcher for suppression. In exchange it demands tungsteel and synthetic fabric to build, costs two points of bandwidth, and defends itself badly at direct range, inheriting the Soldat's thin plating and exposed battery pack. Indirect fire does not distinguish friend from foe - keep it behind your own line. -->
  <DMS_Make_Grenadier.description>組裝擲彈兵，士兵型的曲射火控增強型號。其射控單元經過重新標定以計算拋物線彈道，使它能夠操作各式榴彈發射器、投擲物與迫擊砲座，專門處理躲在掩體後方、直射火力構不著的目標。\n\n它是清理工事陣地與破壞建築最有效率的量產機體，並內建閃光發射器用於壓制。</DMS_Make_Grenadier.description>
  <!-- EN: Gestating mech. -->
  <DMS_Make_Grenadier.jobString>組裝機械體中</DMS_Make_Grenadier.jobString>

  <!-- EN: Gestate Sergeant -->
  <DMS_Make_Sergeant.label>組裝軍士</DMS_Make_Sergeant.label>
  <!-- EN: Gestate a Sergeant Automatroid, the relay-command variant of the Soldat, recognizable by the dish-shaped omnidirectional radar and transceiver mast on its back. Its job is to organize scattered units into a combined automatroid battlegroup, and to hold the command chain open when the mechanitor cannot move forward in person.\n\nIts relay radius far exceeds the Noctula's and reaches into neighboring maps, and its transceiver identification code can be used to request Soldat and Falcon reinforcement drops from orbit. The mass and processing load of the radar cost four times the Soldat's bandwidth, however, and leave it slower, thinner-skinned, and armed with nothing heavier than a sidearm. When a Sergeant goes down, every link it was holding open goes down with it. -->
  <DMS_Make_Sergeant.description>組裝軍士機兵，士兵型的中繼指揮改裝型，特徵是背負的碟形全向雷達與收發天線。它的職責是把分散的機體編組成混成機兵戰鬥集群(CAB)，並在機械師本人無法前推時代為維持指揮鏈。\n\n它的中繼半徑遠大於夜蝠，能將控制範圍延伸至鄰近地圖，並可憑T/R收發器上的辨識代碼向同步軌道請求士兵型與游隼的空投增援。</DMS_Make_Sergeant.description>
  <!-- EN: Gestating mech. -->
  <DMS_Make_Sergeant.jobString>組裝機械體中</DMS_Make_Sergeant.jobString>

</LanguageData>
